{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id42034556"}, "name":{"label":"RussOniPhone"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-09-20T21:57:13-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.3.1"}, "id":{"label":"11747059982"}, "title":{"label":"Good app, but"}, "content":{"label":"Good app, but I never had to pay for an app twice even when logged in with same Apple ID. Contacted company they just said the obvious “if you were logged in with the same Apple ID you shouldn’t have to pay twice. I had in on my iPhone wand wanted it on my iPad but the system didn’t detect I purchased it before. Plus most paid apps tell you within the app you paid for it or are a premium user..  no follow up from developer, sad with such a good app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1465439395&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id31201685"}, "name":{"label":"Jordanjordan10"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-08-15T10:03:18-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.2.6"}, "id":{"label":"11613677746"}, "title":{"label":"A rare gem"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve used this app for years, but today it finally occurred to me to leave a review when it finally dawned on me that this app is such a rare gem!\n\nHere’s a short list of things I love about it:\n- It’s easy to use \n- Its interface is simple, but elegant \n- It has a lot of high quality sound options \n- The developer doesn’t tinker with it or change things needlessly! \n- IT DOESN’T REQUIRE A SUBSCRIPTION \n\nI cannot stress enough how rare those last two points are in the App Store ecosystem. This app was built well and has basically been left alone. You pay once and get to use it as advertised. \n\nTotally worth it!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1465439395&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
