{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id475637384"}, "name":{"label":"Ve’ Gana Kale"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-01-06T12:24:49-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.2.6"}, "id":{"label":"10792172848"}, "title":{"label":"Scam. Always Trying to Rip Me Off."}, "content":{"label":"I like the app. The problem is that the app conveniently forgets quite often that you already have an active subscription. The app then locks you out of the premium features, because it wants you to spend money to sign you up for a more expensive subscription. \nTherefore, I have stopped using the app and canceled my subscription. I refuse to use any app that has a primary focus of using me to make money. Really sad that such a great app has as a primary focus scamming subscribers out of their money. If I could give the app no stars I would. I mean what is the point of paying a subscription to have access to premium features when the app will the next day conveniently forget that you have an active subscription and want you to sign up for an even more expensive subscription.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1465439395&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id486728651"}, "name":{"label":"Guitar For Jesus"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-12-21T16:51:06-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.2.6"}, "id":{"label":"10728970479"}, "title":{"label":"Helpful. Intuitive. Sleek."}, "content":{"label":"I downloaded this app a couple years ago and have been happy with it ever since. Whenever I’m out of Wi-Fi and can’t connect to something on YouTube, I know I can rely on Dark Noise. Their initial price structure was certainly more generous than it is now, however they honored longtime users and grandfathered us in to all the premium features we paid for initially at a lower price. A lot of apps try to circumvent older purchases, so it’s great to see this company has integrity. In addition, their new price structure is not the worst I’ve seen: $20 a year or $50 for a lifetime. It’s no longer a steal, but I would consider it a worthwhile investment if it works for you. Happy napping.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1465439395&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
