{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id244383946"}, "name":{"label":"AV8orFWSEL"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-12-02T23:27:53-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.2.5"}, "id":{"label":"10651999391"}, "title":{"label":"Well built, poor quality sounds"}, "content":{"label":"I downloaded this app from widget ad that showed this app as a sample. I instantly loved the UI and the capability to function with shortcuts. \n\nBut the sound that works best for me(airplane interior) is apparently a very short audio loop with just enough pollution that it keeps me awake! I can hear a faint clicking noise that occurs every few seconds and for a neurodivergent mind, I fixated on the noise. I wish there was better quality audio sampling.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1465439395&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
